Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:18.49,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die\Non your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.77,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:09.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In the end, it is true that\Nthey requested an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:18.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,from the Asian nations, regardless of\Nregrets that we have already expressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:36.86,Sign,,1100,0,600,,{\fs52}Fortune and Longevity
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:23.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That may be especially relevant to those who\Nreceived previous century's postwar education.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:27.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While they passively observed\Nthe war between Asia and Europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:31.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it is true that they fought\Nin the Second Vietnam War,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:35.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the figures of this relief\Nfund are also quite real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:37.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I think I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just think of this as taxpayer money...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:42.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't win against you, Chairman...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Y-You're...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,D-Don't do this, Gino!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,S-save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:19.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,P-P-P-Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:23.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gino-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:25.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gino-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is something wrong, Gino-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:32.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The ride is a bit rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:37.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry about that, Mr. Chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:49.66,Sign - Copy,,500,0,500,,The \N Satiated \N Me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:56.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How about it? Want to go to that restaurant\NI talked about and try their oysters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:57.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:59.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, I think I'll pass today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:02.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why? Is it that "real" job of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:03.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're quite the bread winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:09.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How pitiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:12.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Food is unnecessary to a\Ncyborg with artificial organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:18.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not to mention that to a person who\Nhas had all of his senses digitised,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:20.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,eating "good" food is but nostalgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:25.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you getting pursued\Nby Public Safety again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:36.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Er, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.28,Sign,,0,1400,850,,{\fs35}Document: Refugee Relief Fund\N         Automatic Donation Form
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:42.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, about Nakamatsu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:44.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, I heard he was dumped again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:46.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Food product for cyborgs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:48.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now that I think about\Nit, they are also victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:53.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They were conscripted for the non-nuclear World\NWar IV, also known as the Second Vietnam War,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:57.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and they were implanted with high-performance cyberbrains\Nand cybernetic parts as per military regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:05:01.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The viewpoint that war is a multinational\Ncorporation's bazaar is an appropriate one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:05.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was testing ground that greatly\Nadvanced cybernetic technology...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:07.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's the true identity\Nof the previous great war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:11.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They weren't even aware\Nthat they were guinea pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:15.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They now seem happy, clinging to their nominal\Nstipends and the jobs that were given to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:21.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even though they lost their bodies,\Ntheir families, and even their homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:26.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Never knowing that it's a false\Npleasure created by the virtual persona
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:28.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of their cyberbrains and\Ncybernetic implants...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:33.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Police Department's investigation\Nbranch recently announced
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:37.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that a particularist terrorist\Norganisation has claimed responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,for the recent series of explosions that\Ntargeted residential refugee relief sectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:48.89,Sign,,1250,0,950,,{\fs52}Tomorrow's Weather
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:48.89,Sign,,0,1250,250,,{\fs52}Responsibility Claimed for Series of Explosions \N in Residential Refugee Relief Sectors
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:44.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The terrorist organisation apparently\Ndemands deportation of Asian refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:47.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They state that their action thus\Nfar constitute a retaliatory measure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:52.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,against riots by Asian refugees and the financial\Nplight induced by the current refugee aid policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:55.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:59.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The media merely regurgitates\Nwhat the authorities tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:03.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're fully aware that it's a bluff, but the media\Nmanipulates information and gains profit from it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:07.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's how they work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:16.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What the media wants and\Nwhat it's trying to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All you need to do is look at their\N"other" side to find the answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:24.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Having lost even the ability\Nto objectify their hedonism,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:27.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they continue to laugh\Nat the ignorant masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:44.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's clear enough from\Nthe way that Katakura,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.91,0:06:47.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who is the chairman of the three\Nmajor networks, finds endless fault
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,with those who continue to dine\Nat high-end Japanese restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:53.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To say nothing of the ruling\Ncoalition's leadership,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.09,0:06:56.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,executives of multinational corporations monopolise\Nthe patents for cyberbrains and cybernetic parts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that are in the senior officials\Nof various government agencies...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:02.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Katakura doesn't have the nerve\Nto state the truth at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:07.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What he does have is the\Ndesire to maintain his empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:12.50,Sign,,0,0,200,,{\fs52}Government Administration Offices on Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:12.50,Sign,,0,1250,825,,{\fs52}Above Niihama City
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:14.61,Sign,,0,1400,500,,{\fs52}Government \N Administration \N Offices \N Attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:14.61,Sign,,1280,0,800,,{\fs52}Live
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:19.98,Sign,,0,0,235,,{\fs52}Live Broadcast from Government Administration Offices
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:19.98,Sign,,1475,0,800,,{\fs52}Niihama City
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:18.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Black smoke continues to rise at the scene;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:21.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it is a vivid testimony to the extent of the attack\Non the government administration office building
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:23.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,by Asian refugees\Nprotesting refugee policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:26.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:28.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That won't end anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:31.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Again, nothing will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:37.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Reset the world"...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:43.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The real enemy is the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:47.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They side with authorities and\Nproclaim their righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:49.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, they do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:52.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They do not know that one who\Nknows everything stands here;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:58.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that someone with a strong will who knows and\Nwill attempt to expose the truth exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I must hasten this execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:08.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is the mission of one who does not fear\Ndeath in his knowledge and pursuit of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:23.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A Jewish writer who was prominent in the\Nbeginning of the last century said this:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:29.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"There is no life without truth.\NTruth is probably life itself."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:36.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And this is where true life exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:54.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Her beauty is an undeniable truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:58.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Her natural beauty as a single life-form...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:01.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The enjoyment of pleasure as pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:05.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and on the other hand, the courage to refuse to possess\Nanything except what is necessary for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:08.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The very obvious fact that\Nshe is a complete cyborg...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:12.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,a physical body that cannot be separated\Nfrom an existence specialised for pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.85,0:09:14.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is true beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:21.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can be certain that she is human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:29.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can see something within her that is trying\Nto protect her humanity, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:48.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Everyone else pales before\Nthe brilliance of her psyche.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:57.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if one were to obtain her with money, her\Nwill, beauty, and truth can never be owned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:43.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:51.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No one can sully the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:56.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,no matter how much they brandish their authority\Nand attempt to toy with our feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:58.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Only one knows the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:02.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And I am that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:05.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:08.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tomorrow,\Nthe world will awaken to the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:19.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finally, tomorrow's the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.41,0:11:23.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As I said, tell me if you're\Ngoing to take time off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:26.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't know whether this job is\Nyour primary or secondary one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:33.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but just be happy that you get to be\NChairman Katakura's personal pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:36.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sure, your skills are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You were a hero during the War,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:46.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but there are no jobs for guys like you disabled\Ncombat cyborgs out there in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:49.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:52.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You weren't like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:59.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At the time, you had enough courage\Nto not avert your eyes from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:06.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If it were the old you, you wouldn't have\Nallowed someone like Katakura to go unchecked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.69,0:12:08.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Th-The times have changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.11,0:12:11.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Everyone has to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:16.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have you forgotten why I've withdrawn\Nfrom the military to follow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:23.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:26.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you muttering?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:32.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Er, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:35.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:40.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll leave that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, let the other side...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:44.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:45.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Er, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:47.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I apologise about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I took a break from\Nwork without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:51.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry for inconveniencing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:56.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh... was that how it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:58.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:00.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, it's nothing. Sorry about the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:01.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:08.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:09.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:17.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That damn bastard needs my skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:22.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so he just pretended like he forgot...\NBastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:22.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He got all high and mighty when\NI decided to bend a little...!!!\Nso he just pretended like he forgot...\NBastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:25.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He got all high and mighty when\NI decided to bend a little...!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:28.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I put my mind to it,\Nmy piloting could make you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:48.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My mind's clear and serene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:53.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I do not intend to begrudge the fact that I'll\Nbe sacrificing my life for the pitiful masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:58.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However... even if I am to\Nrid this world of Katakura,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:02.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is possible that their networks\Nwill cover up the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:07.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If that happens,\Nthe truth will not reach the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:13.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In order to prevent that from happening,\NI must tell someone the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My wife stopped speaking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:21.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:24.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You'll have to get her back in a good\Nmood by giving her a lot of "services."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:28.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:31.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How about going drinking for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:35.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If not, that restaurant you mentioned the\Nother day where they have good oysters...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:36.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:37.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:40.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:45.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems like I might have to quit the\Ncompany because of my "real" job...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:45.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:47.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, a promotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:49.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:51.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, it's not like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:56.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, I'd love to accept your offer,\Nconsidering the circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I can't today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:01.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, it's all right. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:25.96,Sign,,1150,0,900,,{\fs52}{\b1}Yakitori{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:17.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I was hauled out to war to fulfil a purpose\Nfar from the one intended for my existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:19.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,just to protect the\Nauthority of a select few.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:23.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No one can understand the magnitude\Nof what I lost on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:40.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's your business here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:48.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd like to buy her with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:49.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:52.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not enough at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:53.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,if that's all you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:57.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.03,0:16:03.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's not just you who lost\Nsomething important in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:13.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:17.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But we haven't done anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:20.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It requires an additional\Nfee if you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:22.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:28.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:30.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I even paid the membership\Nfee as an advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:32.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:51.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,P-P-Please forgive me! If you take\Nthat, my wife and children will...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:17:00.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,W-We won't be able to eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:30.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is the Refugee Relief Fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.58,0:17:35.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry, I'm one of the\Ndonors to your Fund, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:51.10,Sign,,0,0,950,,{\fs52}{\b1}Refugee Relief Fund{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:51.10,Sign,,0,1400,500,,{\fs52}{\b1}Now is \N the time \N to help \N each other{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:51.10,Sign,,1400,0,400,,{\fs52}{\b1}Right now, \N there are \N 3,000,000 refugees \N in Japan, who  \Nhave lost their \N Motherland.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:37.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you for your kindness, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:42.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Um, there's been a complication... and I'd like for you\Nto stop the automated withdrawal from my account...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:45.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Er, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:50.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry! We are unable to\Ndetermine the nature of your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:54.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Er, hello?! I want you to stop\Nwithdrawing from my account!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.63,0:17:56.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I want to cancel my account with the Fund!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.40,0:17:59.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, I will now go over\Nthe sign-up procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.13,0:18:03.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For information regarding\Nyour application, press 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:07.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For information regarding other\Ntopics, press 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:12.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That was the first good\Nwin in a long while!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:15.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, that national team match?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:19.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That right cross was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:20.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, it made me numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:26.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why do you want to eat? \N You don't need to, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.09,0:18:27.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why do you want to eat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:28.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You don't need to, do you?!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:36.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:37.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:37.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why?!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:39.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why do I want to eat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:40.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is not instinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This isn't the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:47.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That sure was a surprise, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:50.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, to think that he'd get taken\Nfor questioning by Public Safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:55.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if he knew...\Nthat the guy was Asian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:18:56.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:56.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gino.\NWho knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:57.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gino.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:18:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The two were close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.71,0:19:02.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Him? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:03.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:04.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yep, Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.61,0:19:11.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Asian refugee terrorist who bombed the administrative\Ngovernment office building has been arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:14.20,Sign,,0,600,260,,{\fs52}Suspect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:14.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The suspect's name is Misawa\NYouichi, AKA You Mintei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:19.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He has just now emerged from the building,\Nflanked on both sides by a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:25.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is it a victory performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:29.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wh-Why is it him...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:38.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Shortly after his arrest, three Asian refugee aid organisations\Nand the Organisation for Refugee Human Rights and Compensation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:39.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,called an unusual press conference,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:39.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in which they stated that his actions represent the\Nsentiments of both Asian and Japanese refugees,\Ncalled an unusual press conference,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:43.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in which they stated that his actions represent the\Nsentiments of both Asian and Japanese refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:46.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who regularly suffer\Nunwarranted discrimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:50.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As such, they allege that the authorities should\Nmake allowance for extenuating circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:53.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and have made clear their intent to\Npursue a reduction in his sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.21,0:20:03.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please take her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:31.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's wrong...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:37.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What did he... Katakura... do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:38.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:44.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I was... looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:46.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the time... for several days...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:50.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, before I was even born...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:51.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:55.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I won't let you suffer anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:20:59.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go far away, just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:03.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to where no one can come between us.\NTo our own country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:07.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But, before that,\NI have something I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.89,0:21:15.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have to... release the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:18.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And take me along in the process?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:36.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You've fought enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.65,0:21:41.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.49,0:21:47.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hope... that's the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:21:59.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, I just heard from Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:02.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There are no connections whatsoever between\Nhim and the serial terrorist events.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.74,0:22:07.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, the loss of his lower body was\Nunrelated to combat, according to military records;
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:10.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he apparently got hit with\Na vicious STD while on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:13.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, Major! Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:14.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:18.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,His assassination plot was just a delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:22.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, how's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:23.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.37,0:22:32.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's one of the many people who have faint\Nhope and frustration towards reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:35.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He could never bring himself\Nto carry out his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.43,0:22:39.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Excuse me... Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:51.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A proletariat who is pitifully\Nignorant of the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:11.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.06,0:23:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.20,0:23:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.73,0:23:20.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:24.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:35.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:37.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:37.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.75,0:23:39.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:41.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.93,0:23:42.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:43.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:44.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:45.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.81,0:23:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:49.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.51,0:23:50.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:50.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:51.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.\NAll I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.51,0:23:53.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:54.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:23:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:00.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:01.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:02.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:04.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:07.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.15,0:24:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.23,0:24:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside, (the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:11.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\NI see inside, (the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:13.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:15.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)\NAll the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.75,0:24:16.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:20.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.38,0:24:20.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside\Nto make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:21.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:26.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
